WEBVTT

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.500
During this period,

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.080
you must keep a low profile,

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.500
as though you were never there.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.700
You must not change anything
that happened in the past.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.700
You...

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.410
What are you doing here?

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:48.410
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.290
didn't you go overseas with Lu Guang?

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.410
Do not attract anyone's attention.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.290
Why are you running?

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.790
Didn't they say that

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.080
they would return right before
the end of summer vacation?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.620
Where did he go?

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.580
Qiao,

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.830
we weren't mistaken, right?

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:06.910
That guy just now was Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:09.330
Where did he disappear off to?

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.750
What if it was a hallucination

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.160
caused by this heat wave?

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.950
How did we bump into
Qiao Ling on accident?

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:18.500
That was too careless!

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.500
Hmm, I don't believe it.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.500
I'll give him a call.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.370
Many of the surveillance cameras in
this old alley have fallen into disrepair.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.080
The blind spots of the cameras

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.160
also limit my field of view.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:33.910
Oh no,

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:35.250
I've lost Doudou.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.750
I can't find them from my side either.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:01.580
It seems that

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:03.660
they've already left the area
that I can monitor.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.120
Doudou.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.250
Doudou!

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:34.700
The task has failed...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.370
Greed and selfishness
will devour all of you!

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:59.000
I'm sorry, Mr. Liang.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.660
We were unable to find any clues
from the surveillance footage.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.290
Don't worry about it.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:07.620
I am already very grateful

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:09.500
that you were willing to help me.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.370
Actually, back when
I was still in university,

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.830
I would often buy milk tea from your shop.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.790
The day Doudou was kidnapped...

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.370
I happened to walk past,

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:21.370
but I did nothing as I
watched him being led away.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.500
If only I had paused to take another look,

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.700
or said something,

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.410
he might not have been kidnapped!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.080
I'm sorry!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.200
I tried to escape the past,

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.120
I didn't dare to face you,

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:43.290
I didn't even have the courage to step
forward and provide any information.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.540
These past three years,

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.080
I firmly believed that

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.700
as long as I continue to search,

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.660
I would find new clues.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:53.580
And now, your presence
has justified my persistence.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.830
You've given me a ray of hope,

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.290
and convinced me that...

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.950
...as long as I continue to search,

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.750
be it ten years, or twenty years,

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.830
or perhaps even longer,

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.250
one day,

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.080
I will definitely find him!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.620
You can do this, Triple Star Warriors!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.660
Quickly get up and defeat Greed!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.910
As long as we have hope,

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.620
we will not be defeated easily!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.700
Besides,

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:21.160
I'm sure Doudou is somewhere
out there waiting for me,

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.700
waiting for his parents

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.660
to bring him home!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.000
Dad...

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.500
Mom...

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.290
All right.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.950
Since we have time
to reminisce on the past,

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.910
we might as well use this time to
continue searching for new clues!

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.910
I agree!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.790
If you don't mind,

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:40.410
I'd like to continue helping you!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.080
That's great!

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.290
Of course you're welcome to help,

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.910
I almost forgot about you.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:47.830
See,

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:50.080
I told you that you had
a very unremarkable presence.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.580
Shut up, you crafty old dog!

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.950
By the way, Mr. Liang,

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:57.080
do you have other photos or information
at the time of the incident?

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.290
I had searched for them when I provided
evidence to the police back then,

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.500
but I don't think I have any more photos
taken at the time of the incident.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.910
Let me look for them again.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:06.910
Hey,

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.040
are you still using the same phone
from three years ago?

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:11.910
I don't dare to change my phone,

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.080
I'm afraid I might lose
the information in here.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.080
They might come in handy anytime.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.830
When were these photos

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.910
of Doudou taken?

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:24.160
These

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.120
were taken on the weekend
before the incident.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.120
I managed to find some time,

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.910
and closed the shop for half a day

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:31.080
to bring him to the aquarium.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.540
Once the shop is open,

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.500
we hardly take any photos

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.540
as we're just too busy.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.040
Hang on! Go back!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.580
Let me see the previous photo!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.290
Hmm?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.000
You mean this one?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.450
Yes, yes, yes, this one!

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:45.540
Oh.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.950
Who took this photo?

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:50.080
This photo

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.540
was taken by Doudou.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.200
He used to take random photos
using my mobile phone.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.790
I've saved them all,

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.660
as I'm unwilling to delete them.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:06:58.830
Now that I think about it,

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.000
this photo was taken on the day...

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.700
At the moment, I don't see
anyone suspicious around.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:13.160
...the day of the incident!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.410
You'd better watch out, Greed!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.830
Star of Hope!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.290
Endow me with the power of justice!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.200
Mr. Liang,

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.620
please lend me your phone.

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:27.290
Lu Guang, look at this.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:28.790
Can we find some new clues?

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.330
It's possible.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.370
Star of Courage,

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.620
obliterate fear.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:05.700
Star of Justice,

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.120
rekindle hope.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.160
Star of Wisdom,

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:09.500
light the way.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.410
This is great!

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:32.040
This point in time

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.080
is exactly a few minutes before
the incident took place.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:37.080
But the whole time, I was unable to get a
good look at the human trafficker's face,

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.410
as well as how she took Doudou away.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.160
I'm quite confused about that, too,

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.870
after all, there were quite a number
of customers around.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:46.870
How did the human trafficker
kidnap Doudou in broad daylight?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.290
You have to be more careful.

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:52.290
This might be our only chance.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.700
I will bring this damned
human trafficker to justice!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.450
It's here!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.330
Come on,

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.160
return the ball to Auntie.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.790
Auntie?

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.080
Hmm?

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:32.450
Why does this little ball smell so good?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:34.830
Don't smell it!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:38.620
So that's how it happened.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.790
No wonder we couldn't
figure out the mystery,

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:41.910
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:50.080
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.660
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.080
My dear nephew,

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.290
come with me.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.870
Your parents are so busy running the shop,

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.370
I'll play with you at home instead.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.660
Hey, why is the kid leaving with someone?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.330
Oh, didn't you hear that she's his Auntie?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.120
His parents were probably
too busy to entertain him,

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.290
so they asked a relative
to bring him home.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.620
What's wrong with me?

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.870
I can't control my body,

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:16.950
my head feels dizzy,

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:18.870
oh no...

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:21.200
My vision is blurry as well...

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.080
Cheng Xiaoshi, Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.080
Let's go and take a look,

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.000
see if the queue is long.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.910
All right.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:29.370
Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.080
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.620
what are you doing here?

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:51.830
Doudou!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.870
Doudou!

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:54.500
Daddy?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.700
Doudou!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:10:59.830
Doudou!

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.540
Oh my, I'm sorry, Doudou,

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.080
Daddy is late.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.410
When Jingjing's mom came
to pick her just now,

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.290
she told me that you and Mom
don't want me anymore!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:12.910
Don't listen to that naughty kid!

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:13.750
Look here,

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.910
see what Daddy bought for you?

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.200
Wow! It's the Star of Justice!

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:20.410
Can I open it now?

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:22.620
Daddy was searching for
the Triple Star Warriors for you,

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.910
that's why I was late.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.910
So, can you forgive your old dad?

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.080
How do you have the nerve to say that!
This is all your fault!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.910
You just had to bargain
for the toy at the street stall.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:32.870
I asked you to hurry up,

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.290
but you still continued
to bargain with the vendor!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.040
Hehe, don't say that,

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.450
Doudou can hear you!

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.580
You're finally awake.

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.080
The human trafficker drugged you,

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:58.250
which made you sleep for a long time.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.120
So

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.790
we're running out of time.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.290
Where am I?

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.870
I don't know,

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.000
I couldn't perceive anything
when you were unconscious.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.250
How can this heartless scumbag

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.410
sleep so soundly?

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.410
Don't just sit around,

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:16.620
hurry and look for clues!

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.500
Red Sun Hostel?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.910
Let me check online.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.370
We don't have this hostel in our city,

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:00.290
but there are more than thirty Red Sun
Hostels throughout the country.

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.580
It seems like the human trafficker have
already transported you out of the city,

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.580
and found a place to hide.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.080
To bring a child out of the city,

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.830
it is inevitable that she would have to
use public transportation.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.540
So she must carry an
identification document on her.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.580
See if you can find

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.750
a handbag or wallet
she would carry on her.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.410
Eureka!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.660
It's her ID card!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:33.910
Damn it.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.160
It's tangled in a talisman.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.160
How ridiculous.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.580
She's done so many evil things,

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.080
yet she's still afraid of ghosts.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.160
Hurry, there isn't have much time left.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.660
There we go.

00:15:13.660 --> 00:15:16.160
So her name is Mei Piyan,

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:22.870
her ID number is 5948108181810.

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:25.830
How did the effect of
the drug wear off so quickly?

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.450
It seems like what I learned
from Master Siwen

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.450
is quite useful.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:58.200
Watch carefully.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.410
This move is called
"Sending You to Heaven."

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.580
It's extremely lethal,

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:06.500
so generally, you should only
use it on animals,

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.160
and not on humans.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.120
She's lucky this is a child's body,

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.250
--You little brat,
--or else she would probably be dead.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.500
I've always beaten up

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.330
the other kids who cried
and made a lot of noise.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.410
But here you are,

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.410
brave enough to hit me!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.580
I'm going to cut off your legs,

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.540
rip out your tongue,

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.370
and throw you out on the streets
to beg for scraps!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:29.790
Hmph, you cruel Mei Piyan!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:33.750
You've done so many bad things, yet you
still dare to boast about those things!

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:35.750
Even God wouldn't tolerate you anymore,

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:38.250
so he sent me to teach you a lesson!

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.080
You crazy kid,

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.790
what the hell are you talking about?

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:53.160
You are destined to be arrested
and brought to justice in three years.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.580
So my advice to you,
is to take good care of this child,

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.540
accumulate your merits
and do more good deeds,

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:00.250
in order to appeal for
leniency in the future.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.750
Otherwise,

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.370
after you die,

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.700
you will dance in hell forever!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.000
You...

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.790
Who exactly are you?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.370
I am...

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.080
...your ancestor!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.540
Dad! Mom!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:26.580
I want Dad and Mom!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.120
Dad, Mom!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.700
Our ancestors are speaking to me!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.330
Mr. Liang, don't be so nervous.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.370
You need to relax, so that your child
can be more comfortable.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:49.830
I-I-I'm not nervous,

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.580
I'm-I'm just excited,

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:52.910
ex-excited.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.580
Hey, I'm still curious.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.370
How did you find the information
on the human trafficker?

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.160
Don't keep me guessing!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.660
I've been searching for my child
these few years,

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.700
so I've accumulated
a good amount of contacts.

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:06.580
There are always kind people
in the world, right?

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:09.040
Honey,

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.370
Doudou is finally coming back today!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:12.700
Your child hasn't seen you in three years,

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.500
there might be a little bit of
psychological resistance,

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:15.700
so you must not rush him.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:18.910
Mr. Liang, you have to be more tolerant.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.410
Okay, I understand,

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.910
so, I have already prepared myself.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.660
Hey, here he is!

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:46.450
Doudou!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.080
Doudou!

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.370
Doudou,

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:55.830
it's Daddy.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:57.790
I'm sorry,

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.120
Daddy is late.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.790
Wow! Look! It's the Triple Star Warriors!

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:13.660
Star of Courage,

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.200
obliterate fear!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.330
Star of Wisdom,

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.870
light the way!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:19.080
Star of Justice,

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.830
rekindle hope!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:21.700
We are

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:23.790
the Three Star Warriors!

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:26.870
I'm sorry, Doudou,

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:29.290
Daddy was searching for
the Triple Star Warriors for you,

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.120
that's why I was late.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.410
So,

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:35.660
can you forgive your old dad?

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:36.870
Daddy,

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:37.830
Daddy!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.200
Doudou.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.410
Doudou.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.500
This is wonderful!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.660
The family is reunited,

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.080
and we've successfully completed the task!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.160
Doudou is back,

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:53.750
Doudou is back!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.330
This is wonderful,

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.580
Doudou!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:04.250
Sir,

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.540
I did not traffick any other children

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.080
within the past three years.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:12.250
Moreover, I raised this child as my own,

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.750
giving him the best I could afford!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:18.330
I have repented my past mistakes everyday,

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.000
I'm begging you,

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.330
--please give me a chance
to have a fresh start!
--Mei Piyan, be a
good person in the future.

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:25.160
Your ancestors are watching you!

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.080
My ancestors! Oh my,
my ancestors are speaking to me!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.120
--What's wrong with you?
--Oh my, my ancestors
are speaking to me again!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.160
--Are you pretending to be crazy,
--Oh my, my ancestors
are speaking to me again!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.410
in hopes that we would let you off lightly
because you have a mental disorder?

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.250
Chen Bin, take her away.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:37.580
--My ancestors are speaking to me again!
--And interrogate her thoroughly!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.620
My ancestors are speaking to me again!

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:44.200
Hey, are you Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.750
Is that white-haired boy
called Lu Guang your partner?

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.830
And this girl called Qiao Ling,

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:52.040
also known as the sorceress
who brags online,

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.540
is actually just a cover.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:57.040
The one who actually has the power
to enter photographs

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.910
is you, right?

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:01.370
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.870
Then explain to me...

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:04.910
Oh my goodness,

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.500
Xiao Chen was just here a few days ago,

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.910
why are you here to see it again?

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.950
Why are you all so invested in the case
from three years ago?

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.290
Hang on!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.450
What is it?

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.080
What's wrong with this person?

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.950
Why don't you explain to me,

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:26.120
why were you seen in
the surveillance footage

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.910
at the entrance of the milk tea
shop three years ago?

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.580
Relax,

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.660
I'm just curious about
how effective your ability is.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:35.250
In this envelope...

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:38.290
...are some photos of a major case
I'm currently dealing with.

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:41.080
If you don't mind,

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.290
could you do me a favor...

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.250
Hold on.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.790
You should ask me first

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:49.290
before taking on a task.
